@startuml merchant-domain-relations
title merchant.domain — model relations

' Names and relations only. Column-level properties are a later task.
' A solid arrow that leaves this context is an id. Contexts do not share tables.

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty members

package merchant {
  package domain {
    class Merchant
  }
}

package ledger <<external>> {
  package domain {
    class Account
  }
}

Merchant "0..1" --> "1" Account : deposit account

note bottom of Merchant
  The shop that gets paid.
  Fixture: Café Orquídea owns account 2200.
  Settlement credits that account from suspense.
  This context does not store purchases or journal lines.
end note

@enduml
